{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"93576","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/93576","key":"MC-256485","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"19/Oct/22 6:52 AM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<h3><a name=\"TheBug%3A\"></a><b>The Bug:</b></h3>\n\n<p>Camels that spawn within villages can spawn inside blocks.</p>\n\n<p>In some cases, this can cause the camels to take suffocation damage and potentially die.</p>\n\n<p>Here is an example:</p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeHeader panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;\"><b>Version: 1.19.3</b></div><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">Seed: -381051283335009767\nCoordinates: /execute in minecraft:overworld run tp @s -446.99 72.00 2502.34 -23.39 6.11</pre>\n</div></div>\n<h3><a name=\"StepstoReproduce%3A\"></a><b>Steps to Reproduce:</b></h3>\n<ol>\n\t<li>Generate a world with the seed provided above and teleport to the given coordinates.</li>\n\t<li>Look closely at the camel and the blocks around it.</li>\n\t<li>Take note as to whether or not camels that spawn within villages can spawn inside blocks.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<h3><a name=\"ObservedBehavior%3A\"></a><b>Observed Behavior:</b></h3>\n\n<p>Camels can spawn inside blocks.</p>\n<h3><a name=\"ExpectedBehavior%3A\"></a><b>Expected Behavior:</b></h3>\n\n<p>Camels would not be able to spawn inside blocks.</p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"26/Oct/22 2:16 PM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/122056","id":"122056","filename":"2022-10-19_09.41.48.png","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/av